transitions, one `decide +kernel` each), and so are the bang-bang pattern sums
(`pat_*`, 223 patterns), the ℓ1 sum and the tail quantities. `VerticalClimb.lean` turns the checks
into statements about the real trajectories (the rounding is absorbed by the ISS bound of
`VerticalCert.lean`).
